{"2726370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Suck Up!", "steam_appid": 2726370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/d5f69c69dc7ff51c296f220ccdabd0f3.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/d5f69c69dc7ff51c296f220ccdabd0f3.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/d5f69c69dc7ff51c296f220ccdabd0f3.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Your Voice to Trick and Bite </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk your way into homes using your real voice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your words carefully. Charm your way inside or blow your cover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/607e80e7813d2ad92605fe6705933ff2.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/607e80e7813d2ad92605fe6705933ff2.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/607e80e7813d2ad92605fe6705933ff2.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Art of Disguise</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up as anything: a knight, a superhero, even your last victim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use costumes and props to earn trust and fool your targets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/8279b065038ae7ff9921b5c6810d4b4b.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/8279b065038ae7ff9921b5c6810d4b4b.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/8279b065038ae7ff9921b5c6810d4b4b.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy Unique Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Love Bites</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash the Valentine's Day party as Anti-cupid and split up every couple you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/f08eaba763c898141e022d6fc2f737e7.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/f08eaba763c898141e022d6fc2f737e7.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/f08eaba763c898141e022d6fc2f737e7.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mic Drop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Rap Battle Arena and out-rhyme iconic characters using your sharpest bars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/fab1a565551aa32ecbf548cfbbd8fc2f.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/fab1a565551aa32ecbf548cfbbd8fc2f.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/fab1a565551aa32ecbf548cfbbd8fc2f.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create and Share Your Own Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Suck Up! you are able to create your own unique character, add them to the game and share them with your friends. Insert your favorite fictional character, or browse the workshop and download entire neighborhoods created by other players. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/69a9be8a56e394379a91f1549dd8a6f9.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/69a9be8a56e394379a91f1549dd8a6f9.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/69a9be8a56e394379a91f1549dd8a6f9.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now and Follow!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Steam launch, you can expect to see more of what you love from Suck Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to be the first to hear about the cool content we are adding at launch, make sure to Wishlist and Follow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/d5f69c69dc7ff51c296f220ccdabd0f3.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/d5f69c69dc7ff51c296f220ccdabd0f3.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/d5f69c69dc7ff51c296f220ccdabd0f3.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Your Voice to Trick and Bite </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk your way into homes using your real voice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your words carefully. Charm your way inside or blow your cover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/607e80e7813d2ad92605fe6705933ff2.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/607e80e7813d2ad92605fe6705933ff2.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/607e80e7813d2ad92605fe6705933ff2.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Art of Disguise</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up as anything: a knight, a superhero, even your last victim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use costumes and props to earn trust and fool your targets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/8279b065038ae7ff9921b5c6810d4b4b.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/8279b065038ae7ff9921b5c6810d4b4b.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/8279b065038ae7ff9921b5c6810d4b4b.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy Unique Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Love Bites</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash the Valentine's Day party as Anti-cupid and split up every couple you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/f08eaba763c898141e022d6fc2f737e7.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/f08eaba763c898141e022d6fc2f737e7.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/f08eaba763c898141e022d6fc2f737e7.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mic Drop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Rap Battle Arena and out-rhyme iconic characters using your sharpest bars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/fab1a565551aa32ecbf548cfbbd8fc2f.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/fab1a565551aa32ecbf548cfbbd8fc2f.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/fab1a565551aa32ecbf548cfbbd8fc2f.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create and Share Your Own Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Suck Up! you are able to create your own unique character, add them to the game and share them with your friends. Insert your favorite fictional character, or browse the workshop and download entire neighborhoods created by other players. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/69a9be8a56e394379a91f1549dd8a6f9.poster.avif?t=1759336476\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/69a9be8a56e394379a91f1549dd8a6f9.webm?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726370/extras/69a9be8a56e394379a91f1549dd8a6f9.mp4?t=1759336476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now and Follow!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Steam launch, you can expect to see more of what you love from Suck Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to be the first to hear about the cool content we are adding at launch, make sure to Wishlist and Follow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Ready for a vampire adventure in a quiet little town? Suck Up! is a comedic game where you survive as a bloodsucking vampire in the human world. Talk to real AI characters, fool them into trusting you, and find a way into their homes to feed without getting caught.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>